> I have a magic marker.  I'm a 12th level Wizard.  I read a remove
> curse scroll, then wrote a remove curse spellbook.  I tried to write
> an identify spellbook, however, and I get the "My Diary" failure
> message.  I had previously read an identify scroll, and just to make
